{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4eec7588b1a94208f80cd3a1c2ee138cc5a6f932e868a8d1b374a1bf9ad4484a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_22_t01:1_2_009_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c9f091ce46c084ca514dd9c3743c46b6988c49636133fa87bc285462b7f1cc4",
      "text": "喂，制作人？\n没什么，我也想为今天的事向你道声谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_22_t01:1_2_009_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9657c9934e4876019e5f3f129abec70d5636cefc7fbe5b9aed1df9aedde0ebb",
      "text": "面对面说这种话我不太习惯。\n虽然打电话有点不好意思，能耽误你一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_22_t01:1_2_009_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e30131bb10926d699e518f30a6a16d463184d2f6db014be800efa07232ad7f33",
      "text": "皮埃尔和实先生，\n最近一阵子一直留下来帮我筹备……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_22_t01:1_2_009_22_t01:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76f9616e542896b0842cb5b3b6bbce71873a07b7e77c1f014477783cfe93d432",
      "text": "虽然一开始有点懵，\n但更多的是高兴。……真的超级开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_22_t01:1_2_009_22_t01:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d82f7c88972afe04b0a35b3b3df2b68d7846643e2819947c3ba11d52555ce616",
      "text": "你也是，又张罗休息室又订蛋糕的……\n明明工作那么忙还帮了这么多忙，谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_22_t01:1_2_009_22_t01:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:282ab9d760ab4e7ae3bb10ed3df6df4bccedd7b23401d1c25fc29592418de307",
      "text": "这都是多亏了\n他们两位的提议",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_22_t01:1_2_009_22_t01:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4459ab217f9a7b7153361fd23cf34753797deb82edf6a0e9c70d7ce871aa37f7",
      "text": "这点小事\n尽管交给我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_22_t01:1_2_009_22_t01:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:566b85fc980c08a9f292d4562bbdf9860b7569915f9d69a3a53481c22758e891",
      "text": "嗯，改天也得再向皮埃尔和实先生\n好好道谢才行啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_22_t01:1_2_009_22_t01:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bfd19cfdd9976942b7f5970758c15f9dc847c678ddebe884aab29b257a48bce",
      "text": "呵，咱家的制作人\n果然很靠得住啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_22_t01:1_2_009_22_t01:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9714865d73fd67a987e946c4ef55a389f11653edb92842946fdc03d4a20844f8",
      "text": "再说一遍，今天真的很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_22_t01:1_2_009_22_t01:cmd-000031:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1daeeb2e30cac75f6bc398ac8557b6c904cc388af64a1d892e557a358c1c556d",
      "text": "明年的生日也\n很让人期待呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_22_t01:1_2_009_22_t01:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee766456df3758ea48dc34d83f70b9e510662edebe11553d39194977d7b731ad",
      "text": "说明年也太远了吧。\n嘛，虽然说不期待那绝对是骗人的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_22_t01:1_2_009_22_t01:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e30a06566b52be0f6462ff6bdcb0cea27ef21d9bd5f323c1e4774791bbe3a69c",
      "text": "总之，明天起我也会和他们两个人一起，\n做好自己能做的事的。那就，晚安了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
